    {"id":"nmvur0ft80","t":1.33,"tag":"acting","text":"Modified the halt animation to start earlier, was frame 4, now starts at 10.","at":{"line":1,"id":"payne_intro_1","lt":0,"ld":7.76,"word":null,"wi":-1,"wa":null,"inWord":false,"after":false,"cut":0,"shot":"two","act":"halt","voice":"4c5c66bbb47d3754f62529dbf07c1585d6d3a049"},"reopened":[{"at":"2026-10-30T09:08:24.656Z","what":"","reopened":"2026-10-30T09:08:35.570Z"}],"done":{"at":"2026-10-31T02:14:17.970Z","what":""}},
    {"id":"nmvtaler01","t":2.97,"tag":"timing","text":"The \"Haha\" laugh animation should have Payne laughing here. See the next timing note. The \"Haha\" animation should start about 0.4s earlier.","at":{"line":1,"id":"payne_intro_1","lt":1.64,"ld":7.76,"word":"...Ha,","wi":2,"wa":1.66,"inWord":true,"after":false,"cut":0,"shot":"two","act":"haha","voice":"4c5c66bbb47d3754f62529dbf07c1585d6d3a049"},"done":{"at":"2026-10-29T12:00:00.000Z","what":"The laugh (haha) starts 0.4s earlier: 0.94s into line 1."},"carried":{"from":"KatanaKitties_Payne_Overview.mp4","how":"same","t":2.789},"madeAt":{"line":1,"id":"payne_intro_1","lt":1.64,"word":"...Ha,","wi":2,"inWord":true,"after":false,"cut":0,"shot":"two","act":"haha","voice":"4c5c66bbb47d3754f62529dbf07c1585d6d3a049","wa":1.66}},
    {"id":"nmvusammi0","t":3.15,"tag":"acting","text":"Let's remove restMasked here.","at":{"line":1,"id":"payne_intro_1","lt":1.82,"ld":7.76,"word":"...Ha,","wi":2,"wa":1.66,"inWord":true,"after":false,"cut":0,"shot":"two","act":"haha","voice":"4c5c66bbb47d3754f62529dbf07c1585d6d3a049"},"done":{"at":"2026-10-31T02:13:57.086Z","what":""}},
    {"id":"nmvtahno50","t":3.37,"tag":"timing","text":"At this point in the \"Haha\" animation is Payne actually starting the laugh animation, so this should begin when she is actually laughing, so this animation needs to start earlier. The \"Haha\" animation should start about 0.4s earlier.\n\nAlso, for the \"Haha\" animation, we should only play the bouncing laugh once, currently she bounces 3 times which looks weird, so need to just do 1 bounce.","at":{"line":1,"id":"payne_intro_1","lt":2.04,"ld":7.76,"word":"...Ha,","wi":2,"wa":1.66,"inWord":false,"after":false,"cut":0,"shot":"two","act":"restMasked","voice":"4c5c66bbb47d3754f62529dbf07c1585d6d3a049"},"done":{"at":"2026-10-29T12:00:00.000Z","what":"haha is now halt frames 46–67: from where she actually starts laughing, through ONE bounce (the head's first low is frame 64, the second 70)."},"carried":{"from":"KatanaKitties_Payne_Overview.mp4","how":"same","t":3.19},"madeAt":{"line":1,"id":"payne_intro_1","lt":2.04,"word":"...Ha,","wi":2,"inWord":false,"after":false,"cut":0,"shot":"two","act":"haha","voice":"4c5c66bbb47d3754f62529dbf07c1585d6d3a049","wa":1.66}},
    {"id":"nmvtav3kw2","t":3.43,"tag":"acting","text":"After \"Haha\" animation, immediately go to RestMasked animation and hold.","at":{"line":1,"id":"payne_intro_1","lt":2.1,"ld":7.76,"word":"kidding.","wi":3,"wa":2.11,"inWord":true,"after":false,"cut":0,"shot":"two","act":"restMasked","voice":"4c5c66bbb47d3754f62529dbf07c1585d6d3a049"},"done":{"at":"2026-10-29T12:00:00.000Z","what":"After haha she cuts straight to restMasked and holds (1.82s into line 1)."},"carried":{"from":"KatanaKitties_Payne_Overview.mp4","how":"same","t":3.248},"madeAt":{"line":1,"id":"payne_intro_1","lt":2.1,"word":"kidding.","wi":3,"inWord":true,"after":false,"cut":0,"shot":"two","act":"haha","voice":"4c5c66bbb47d3754f62529dbf07c1585d6d3a049","wa":2.11}},
    {"id":"nmvtb6mgi3","t":3.44,"tag":"acting","text":"For the \"kidding\" voice, we can use the \"Shrug\" animation, just part of it, from about the 1s - 3s mark in the animation. Since we are in the RestMasked pose, should be a smooth transition into Shrug and can hold the ending 3s pose.\n\nLet's try ping-pong the shrug animation at the end so that it ends at RestMasked like we started, in time for the next animation.","at":{"line":1,"id":"payne_intro_1","lt":2.11,"ld":7.76,"word":"kidding.","wi":3,"wa":2.11,"inWord":true,"after":false,"cut":0,"shot":"two","act":"kidding","voice":"4c5c66bbb47d3754f62529dbf07c1585d6d3a049"},"done":{"at":"2026-10-29T12:00:00.000Z","what":"New clip \"kidding\": the shrug take's 1–3s (frames 24–72), played out and back once so it ends on restMasked; starts on \"kidding\" (2.11s) at 1.7x."},"carried":{"from":"KatanaKitties_Payne_Overview.mp4","how":"same","t":3.26},"madeAt":{"line":1,"id":"payne_intro_1","lt":2.11,"word":"kidding.","wi":3,"inWord":true,"after":false,"cut":0,"shot":"two","act":"haha","voice":"4c5c66bbb47d3754f62529dbf07c1585d6d3a049","wa":2.11}},
    {"id":"nmvusrdff1","t":6.079,"tag":"acting","text":"Let's remove restMasked here.","at":{"line":1,"id":"payne_intro_1","lt":4.75,"ld":7.76,"word":"halts.","wi":6,"wa":3.92,"inWord":true,"after":false,"cut":1,"shot":"ots","act":"kidding","voice":"4c5c66bbb47d3754f62529dbf07c1585d6d3a049"},"done":{"at":"2026-10-31T02:14:00.159Z","what":""}},
    {"id":"nmvtbhbhq0","t":6.27,"tag":"acting","text":"There may be a transition here from the shrug animation to the beckon animation. Let's make that a sharp/abrupt transition, no need for fading between the animations as that looks a bit weird, it's okay if it's a bit choppy transition.","at":{"line":1,"id":"payne_intro_1","lt":4.94,"ld":7.76,"word":"halts.","wi":6,"wa":3.92,"inWord":false,"after":false,"cut":1,"shot":"ots","act":"restMasked","voice":"4c5c66bbb47d3754f62529dbf07c1585d6d3a049"},"done":{"at":"2026-10-29T12:00:00.000Z","what":"Hard cut from restMasked to the beckon at 4.94s."},"carried":{"from":"KatanaKitties_Payne_Overview.mp4","how":"same","t":6.089},"madeAt":{"line":1,"id":"payne_intro_1","lt":4.94,"word":"halts.","wi":6,"inWord":false,"after":false,"cut":1,"shot":"ots","act":"haha","voice":"4c5c66bbb47d3754f62529dbf07c1585d6d3a049","wa":3.92}},
    {"id":"nmvtboo0j1","t":9.49,"tag":"other","text":"When we transition from one animation to the next, dont do a fade between them, just do a hard cut to the next one.","at":{"line":2,"id":"payne_intro_2","lt":0,"ld":3.37,"word":"You","wi":0,"wa":0,"inWord":true,"after":false,"cut":0,"shot":"ots","act":"restMasked","voice":"5a730134ad44039fccf361011639be9f4995ea62"},"done":{"at":"2026-10-29T12:00:00.000Z","what":"Every change of clip is a hard cut: the crossfade is gone from PayneActor (pinned by tools/checks/payneintro.mjs)."},"carried":{"from":"KatanaKitties_Payne_Overview.mp4","how":"word","t":9.309},"madeAt":{"line":2,"id":"payne_intro_2","lt":0,"word":"You","wi":0,"inWord":true,"after":false,"cut":0,"shot":"ots","act":null,"voice":"a0007a60b9131663b9f0846a6d8ec87f7a606e3c","wa":0}},
    {"id":"nmvvroelg0","t":11.211,"tag":"timing","text":"Have mask animation play here (or a bit later) to time the animation with the camera change.","at":{"line":2,"id":"payne_intro_2","lt":1.72,"ld":3.37,"word":"right?","wi":8,"wa":1.66,"inWord":true,"after":false,"cut":1,"shot":"herClose","act":"mask","voice":"5a730134ad44039fccf361011639be9f4995ea62"},"done":{"at":"2026-10-31T12:00:00.000Z","what":"Line 2's unmask now starts on the camera cut to her close-up (\"right?\"): mask cue 1.61 -> 1.72s, so the faceplate clears at 3.51 and the unmask ends at 5.29, inside the line's hold."}},
    {"id":"nmvtbru2z2","t":11.38,"tag":"timing","text":"This is where Payne starts a face reveal, we will need to push this reveal back to be later. Look at the next note. This should happen after she says Fine.","at":{"line":2,"id":"payne_intro_2","lt":1.89,"ld":3.37,"word":"right?","wi":8,"wa":1.66,"inWord":true,"after":false,"cut":1,"shot":"herClose","act":"mask","voice":"5a730134ad44039fccf361011639be9f4995ea62"},"done":{"at":"2026-10-29T12:00:00.000Z","what":"The face reveal moved later: the unmask starts 1.61s into line 2, so the face clears at 3.40s, after \"Fine.\" (2.85–3.19s)."},"carried":{"from":"KatanaKitties_Payne_Overview.mp4","how":"word","t":11.205},"madeAt":{"line":2,"id":"payne_intro_2","lt":1.89,"word":"right?","wi":8,"inWord":true,"after":false,"cut":1,"shot":"herClose","act":"mask","voice":"a0007a60b9131663b9f0846a6d8ec87f7a606e3c","wa":1.66}},
    {"id":"nmvtbvf3z3","t":12.34,"tag":"text","text":"Let's remove this 2nd \"Fine\" sentence, it's not needed to say fine twice.","at":{"line":2,"id":"payne_intro_2","lt":2.85,"ld":3.37,"word":"Fine.","wi":9,"wa":2.85,"inWord":true,"after":false,"cut":1,"shot":"herClose","act":"mask","voice":"5a730134ad44039fccf361011639be9f4995ea62"},"done":{"at":"2026-10-29T12:00:00.000Z","what":"The second \"Fine!\" is cut: payne_intro_2.mp3 trimmed to 3.40s (original kept in out/voice-takes/l2_old.mp3) and removed from the subtitle."},"carried":{"from":"KatanaKitties_Payne_Overview.mp4","how":"word","t":12.878},"madeAt":{"line":2,"id":"payne_intro_2","lt":3.57,"word":"Fine!","wi":10,"inWord":true,"after":false,"cut":1,"shot":"herClose","act":"mask","voice":"a0007a60b9131663b9f0846a6d8ec87f7a606e3c"}},
    {"id":"nmvtc0sf34","t":12.84,"tag":"timing","text":"This is where we should start the face reveal, after she says fine. This is about 1.4s later. We will likely want to delay the next \"tadaa\" part to start about that much later as well.","at":{"line":2,"id":"payne_intro_2","lt":3.35,"ld":3.37,"word":"Fine.","wi":9,"wa":2.85,"inWord":false,"after":false,"cut":1,"shot":"herClose","act":"mask","voice":"5a730134ad44039fccf361011639be9f4995ea62"},"done":{"at":"2026-10-29T12:00:00.000Z","what":"Reveal after \"Fine.\" as above; line 2 now holds 1.6s so the unmask finishes (5.37s) before line 3's tadaa."},"carried":{"from":"KatanaKitties_Payne_Overview.mp4","how":"word","t":12.662},"madeAt":{"line":2,"id":"payne_intro_2","lt":3.35,"word":"Fine.","wi":9,"inWord":false,"after":false,"cut":1,"shot":"herClose","act":"mask","voice":"a0007a60b9131663b9f0846a6d8ec87f7a606e3c","wa":2.85}},
    {"id":"nmvtc8gv85","t":15.09,"tag":"acting","text":"No need for a fading transition here as the ending of the face reveal ends in the same pose as the beginning of tadaa animation, just should ensure they align more or less.","at":{"line":3,"id":"payne_intro_3","lt":0,"ld":5.17,"word":null,"wi":-1,"wa":null,"inWord":false,"after":false,"cut":0,"shot":"herClose","act":"tadaa","voice":"95c45779801318fa734210952df721d57ad335c2"},"done":{"at":"2026-10-29T12:00:00.000Z","what":"No fade: the unmask ends on her held pose and the tadaa opens from that same pose, a hard cut."},"carried":{"from":"KatanaKitties_Payne_Overview.mp4","how":"same","t":14.03},"madeAt":{"line":3,"id":"payne_intro_3","lt":0,"word":null,"wi":-1,"inWord":false,"after":false,"cut":0,"shot":"herClose","act":"tadaa","voice":"95c45779801318fa734210952df721d57ad335c2"}},
    {"id":"nmvtcgyx87","t":17.99,"tag":"acting","text":"Let's hard transition to a talking animation here like \"payne_wag_999697c0.mp4\" has at the first 2 seconds (in the docs\\art-masters\\video)","at":{"line":3,"id":"payne_intro_3","lt":2.9,"ld":5.17,"word":"Professional","wi":3,"wa":2.76,"inWord":true,"after":false,"cut":1,"shot":"twoOther","act":"wagTalk","voice":"95c45779801318fa734210952df721d57ad335c2"},"done":{"at":"2026-10-29T12:00:00.000Z","what":"New clip \"wagTalk\" (the wag take's first 2s, frames 0–48) hard-cuts in on \"Professional\" (2.76s into line 3)."},"carried":{"from":"KatanaKitties_Payne_Overview.mp4","how":"same","t":16.928},"madeAt":{"line":3,"id":"payne_intro_3","lt":2.9,"word":"Professional","wi":3,"inWord":true,"after":false,"cut":1,"shot":"twoOther","act":"thumb","voice":"95c45779801318fa734210952df721d57ad335c2","wa":2.76}},
    {"id":"nmvtcmwx49","t":19.49,"tag":"timing","text":"Here is where she starts to say hello, so the speaking animation should begin here. See the next note.","at":{"line":3,"id":"payne_intro_3","lt":4.4,"ld":5.17,"word":"Hello!","wi":5,"wa":4.4,"inWord":true,"after":false,"cut":2,"shot":"ots","act":"wave","voice":"95c45779801318fa734210952df721d57ad335c2"},"done":{"at":"2026-10-29T12:00:00.000Z","what":"The wave starts 3.65s into line 3, so its \"hello\" mouth (0.75s into the clip) lands on \"Hello!\" (4.40s)."},"carried":{"from":"KatanaKitties_Payne_Overview.mp4","how":"same","t":18.429},"madeAt":{"line":3,"id":"payne_intro_3","lt":4.4,"word":"Hello!","wi":5,"inWord":true,"after":false,"cut":2,"shot":"ots","act":"wave","voice":"95c45779801318fa734210952df721d57ad335c2","wa":4.4}},
    {"id":"nmvtckz8b8","t":19.64,"tag":"timing","text":"Here is where she starts to animate the words \"hello\" in the wave animation, so let's make that start when she says \"hello\", see the earlier note.","at":{"line":3,"id":"payne_intro_3","lt":4.55,"ld":5.17,"word":"Hello!","wi":5,"wa":4.4,"inWord":true,"after":false,"cut":2,"shot":"ots","act":"wave","voice":"95c45779801318fa734210952df721d57ad335c2"},"done":{"at":"2026-10-29T12:00:00.000Z","what":"As the note before: the wave's hello is on \"Hello!\"."},"carried":{"from":"KatanaKitties_Payne_Overview.mp4","how":"same","t":18.579},"madeAt":{"line":3,"id":"payne_intro_3","lt":4.55,"word":"Hello!","wi":5,"inWord":true,"after":false,"cut":2,"shot":"ots","act":"wave","voice":"95c45779801318fa734210952df721d57ad335c2","wa":4.4}},
    {"id":"nmvtd33z90","t":20.56,"tag":"acting","text":"We can start the PointUp animation here, but using the \"payne_point_bb16dc52.mp4\" and starting at about the 1s mark so that she strikes a pose before smoothly transitioning to the pointUp animation.","at":{"line":3,"id":"payne_intro_3","lt":5.47,"ld":5.17,"word":"Hello!","wi":5,"wa":4.4,"inWord":false,"after":true,"cut":2,"shot":"ots","act":"pointPose","voice":"95c45779801318fa734210952df721d57ad335c2"},"done":{"at":"2026-10-29T12:00:00.000Z","what":"New clip \"pointPose\": the point take from its 1s mark (frame 24) to the held point, starting 5.45s into line 3 and carried into line 4 without restarting."},"carried":{"from":"KatanaKitties_Payne_Overview.mp4","how":"end","t":19.499},"madeAt":{"line":3,"id":"payne_intro_3","lt":5.47,"word":"Hello!","wi":5,"inWord":false,"after":true,"cut":2,"shot":"ots","act":"wave","voice":"95c45779801318fa734210952df721d57ad335c2","wa":4.4}}
